   "effective_input_cap": {
    "chunk_chars": 800,
    "note": "the shipped index clips every embedded text to 800 chars (~200-400 tokens), far below the card's 8,192 tokens and config.json's 262,144 positions; the cap actually in force is the character clip. ST max_seq_length and the llama-server n_ctx/n_ubatch actually used are recorded per run by the parity gate."
   },
